speechtext:
1.	Have any thefts of money, postage stamps or anything of value occurred in Canadian post offices, since April 1, 1955?
2.	If so, for each such theft, (a) where did it take place; (b) what was the amount involved;
(c)	what was the date of the theft; (d) has court action been instituted against specific individuals; (e) what was the result of such action, if any?
